abstract: >-
  Code accompanying Benchmarking a bounded-coordinate DeepONet for unsaturated
  flow and solute transport under time-varying infiltration, accepted by the
  Journal of Hydrology (HYDROL 136388). Full training data and checkpoints are
  not included in this compact local-source reconstruction.
